  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Ken Campbell includes his poem Storm song, and illustrations of a statue of Shiva, the flagstone steps up to Whitby Abbey, and the black flag of anarchy.  Each page reveals another line of the poem. The illustrations are made with super-imposed lino blocks, zinc blocks, and metallic dusting. The text block is a traditional rectangle, the boards into which it is bound are a trapezoid, as is the slipcase.</subfield>
